### note: Source-derived G4 candidate, not admitted or confirmed on the published host. Reject a pending event with its original parent token, event If-Match and stable Idempotency-Key. The receipt/audit is atomic; exact retry rechecks current authority and returns the historical result. Physical delete is unavailable.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8088
@sessionCookie = replace-with-session-cookie-value
@folhaId = 42
@eventoId = 21
@xsrfToken = replace-with-XSRF-TOKEN-cookie-value

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/human-resources/eventos-folha/{{eventoId}}/actions/reject
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: SESSION={{sessionCookie}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrfToken}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrfToken}}
If-Match: "replace-with-exact-resource-ETag-from-the-same-GET-snapshot"
Idempotency-Key: replace-with-one-stable-command-key

< ../../payloads/resources/payroll_g4_event_reject.json
